  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incredible Villages</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2018 Agroportal.UA started &#x201c;Incredible Villages&#x201c; to promote green tourism in Ukraine. Since 2022 it is aimed at strengthening small producers in rural areas and focusses on community-based food security in Ukraine. This project is called CraftUP Ukraine and the main focus is to support craft food producers in Ukraine to scale up there production while preserving regional and authentic features. Depending on the lessons learned in this pilot for 50 producers, the end-result could be converting the informal group around &#x201c;Incredible Villages&#x201d; into a professional association for the Craft sector that helps local producers to meet European Union (EU) standards and register their production.</narrative>
  </description>
